[{:db/id "q-86791/selection/fe4374ec8b7362d3ca82bc95356d647f592832d2266870a8f965509b629b4109" :answer/id #uuid "a90fc085-6da9-5793-adf4-d3fc1c0a7e40" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y-2=\\pm 2(x+2)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-86791/selection/1699061dbdd9aa39d0a820f8b27afd7e209869fc83cd0ea55726ff2a8e5e3d9b" :answer/id #uuid "5f52750b-c8cc-565a-8ca4-164813a4d64a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y+2=\\pm \\frac{1}{2}(x+2)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-86791/selection/d9d9463c7d38ae10de822a3457ba816a620848dfba948e810729f7d010ad5893" :answer/id #uuid "e704999b-2eb5-5f10-af2d-6206dc7ee485" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y+2=\\pm \\frac{1}{4}(x-2)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-86791/selection/4eaa63f98f137824ea1d59da5e659b1a878899b4a72ca3602c7e08ce1ca9e5e5" :answer/id #uuid "847ece12-3b82-51ab-99d5-04d4583be870" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y+2=\\pm 4(x-2)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-86791/selection/ae7d381952c38f388e163e4dd12534394493656e84d6408d5cd727ab4b5bc46d" :answer/id #uuid "94dc00b7-77c6-5e92-9b58-7fb032fa9356" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y-2=\\pm 4(x+2)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-86791/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "81eb7818-3bd0-54f5-9076-bf68df896d65" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-86791/selection/d9d9463c7d38ae10de822a3457ba816a620848dfba948e810729f7d010ad5893" :answer-field/choices ["q-86791/selection/fe4374ec8b7362d3ca82bc95356d647f592832d2266870a8f965509b629b4109" "q-86791/selection/1699061dbdd9aa39d0a820f8b27afd7e209869fc83cd0ea55726ff2a8e5e3d9b" "q-86791/selection/d9d9463c7d38ae10de822a3457ba816a620848dfba948e810729f7d010ad5893" "q-86791/selection/4eaa63f98f137824ea1d59da5e659b1a878899b4a72ca3602c7e08ce1ca9e5e5" "q-86791/selection/ae7d381952c38f388e163e4dd12534394493656e84d6408d5cd727ab4b5bc46d"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-86791" :question/id #uuid "d0dfd5e6-7533-5893-9049-cca7e6b67e63" :question/math-academy-id "q-86791" :question/problem "Calculate the asymptotes of the hyperbola $16{y}^{2}-{x}^{2}+4x+64y+44=0.$" :question/worked-solution "To rewrite the equation of the hyperbola in standard form, we need to group the $x$ and $y$ terms and complete the squares, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}16{y}^{2}-{x}^{2}+4x+64y+44 & =0 \\\\ 16{y}^{2}+64y-{x}^{2}+4x & =-44 \\\\ 16[{y}^{2}+4y]-[{x}^{2}-4x] & =-44 \\\\ 16[(y+2)^{2}-4]-[(x-2)^{2}-4] & =-44 \\\\ 16(y+2)^{2}-64-(x-2)^{2}+4 & =-44 \\\\ 16(y+2)^{2}-(x-2)^{2} & =-44+64-4 \\\\ 16(y+2)^{2}-(x-2)^{2} & =16 \\\\ \\frac{16(y+2)^{2}}{16}-\\frac{(x-2)^{2}}{16} & =\\frac{16}{16} \\\\ (y+2)^{2}-\\frac{(x-2)^{2}}{16} & =1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe asymptotes of a vertical hyperbola\n\n$$\n\\frac{(y-k)^{2}}{{a}^{2}}-\\frac{(x-h)^{2}}{{b}^{2}}=1\n$$\n\nare given by \n\n$$\ny-k=\\pm \\frac{a}{b}(x-h).\n$$\n\nIn our case, we have \n\n$$\n(h,k)=(2,-2),\\,a=\\sqrt{1}=1,\\,b=\\sqrt{16}=4.\n$$\n\nTherefore, the asymptotes of the hyperbola are\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y+2 & =\\pm \\frac{1}{4}(x-2).\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-86791/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "d19a514c-faa5-5f69-9870-87f78878f08a"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-86791"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-165483/selection/b3f8d655e9e191e5799668719aabea3ae7d104283880790e144466ab15a939da" :answer/id #uuid "00f9e819-0711-599f-b016-f041661a29dd" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y-1=\\pm \\frac{1}{2}(x-1)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-165483/selection/f50d3b88f9b550dff274c94d5d91e24763de2d952e9429a47bce785f37ea00d7" :answer/id #uuid "98fb6adf-2efa-5a13-b312-03192daac55c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y-2=\\pm 5(x-1)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-165483/selection/8e7423c9b9f36a3f3b075bf7771df244e257b9408bd52be79ef14ef99c81b171" :answer/id #uuid "9206aa7a-0fa2-5726-9a57-74c0b5a833f7" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y-1=\\pm 5(x+1)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-165483/selection/f4ab8014124da3b88111446cc2af26b0b088b9781b8ea1c5036a79a850bc522e" :answer/id #uuid "00a0a2d0-1d35-5515-8b27-0ce97bee0627" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y+2=\\pm 2(x+1)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-165483/selection/bdfc9f418e44bc0a398e3d14aaefe08d719042aa343ff950d859cc889c9f41e7" :answer/id #uuid "98623e6a-2f74-59a5-9b92-382f760f9550" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y-2=\\pm \\frac{1}{5}(x-2)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-165483/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "023dd63b-1ad0-50d9-a4df-01e2d0577423" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-165483/selection/f50d3b88f9b550dff274c94d5d91e24763de2d952e9429a47bce785f37ea00d7" :answer-field/choices ["q-165483/selection/b3f8d655e9e191e5799668719aabea3ae7d104283880790e144466ab15a939da" "q-165483/selection/f50d3b88f9b550dff274c94d5d91e24763de2d952e9429a47bce785f37ea00d7" "q-165483/selection/8e7423c9b9f36a3f3b075bf7771df244e257b9408bd52be79ef14ef99c81b171" "q-165483/selection/f4ab8014124da3b88111446cc2af26b0b088b9781b8ea1c5036a79a850bc522e" "q-165483/selection/bdfc9f418e44bc0a398e3d14aaefe08d719042aa343ff950d859cc889c9f41e7"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-165483" :question/id #uuid "91c1c8c4-74ef-5df2-b862-509a3ca27ef4" :question/math-academy-id "q-165483" :question/problem "Calculate the asymptotes of the hyperbola \n${y}^{2}-25{x}^{2}-4y+50x-46=0.$" :question/worked-solution "To rewrite the equation of the hyperbola in standard form, we need to group the $x$ and $y$ terms and complete the squares, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{y}^{2}-25{x}^{2}-4y+50x-46 & =0 \\\\ {y}^{2}-4y-25{x}^{2}+50x-46 & =0 \\\\ [{y}^{2}-4y]-25[{x}^{2}-2x]-46 & =0 \\\\ [(y-2)^{2}-4]-25[(x-1)^{2}-1]-46 & =0 \\\\ (y-2)^{2}-4-25(x-1)^{2}+25-46 & =0 \\\\ (y-2)^{2}-25(x-1)^{2} & =46+4-25 \\\\ (y-2)^{2}-25(x-1)^{2} & =25 \\\\ \\frac{(y-2)^{2}}{25}-(x-1)^{2} & =1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe asymptotes of a vertical hyperbola\n\n$$\n\\frac{(y-k)^{2}}{{a}^{2}}-\\frac{(x-h)^{2}}{{b}^{2}}=1\n$$\n\nare given by \n\n$$\ny-k=\\pm \\frac{a}{b}(x-h).\n$$\n\nIn our case, we have \n\n$$\n(h,k)=(1,2),\\,a=\\sqrt{25}=5,\\,b=\\sqrt{1}=1.\n$$\n\nTherefore, the asymptotes of the hyperbola are\n\n$$\ny-2=\\pm 5(x-1).\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-165483/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "d19a514c-faa5-5f69-9870-87f78878f08a"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-165483"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-325365/field-1/5dd1399e760b79239f8d07450e398754448dd07c2cd96eccfd06823d198320f0" :answer/id #uuid "b725303b-ffe0-56ca-bdb7-e5002785b3ea" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{2}{3}(x+3)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-325365/field-1/32e34052066a6c762cc117e019aead0b50181ca0cf3e1254068fd86bdd9d93e3" :answer/id #uuid "48c146d5-bc1a-55c8-8154-001b3bbd5d40" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{3}{2}(x+3)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-325365/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "32719783-0d02-5464-ba52-1c11f69ed8b5" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-325365/field-1/5dd1399e760b79239f8d07450e398754448dd07c2cd96eccfd06823d198320f0" :answer-field/choices ["q-325365/field-1/5dd1399e760b79239f8d07450e398754448dd07c2cd96eccfd06823d198320f0" "q-325365/field-1/32e34052066a6c762cc117e019aead0b50181ca0cf3e1254068fd86bdd9d93e3"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-325365" :question/id #uuid "be726065-ce9d-5004-b5f1-84da122847df" :question/math-academy-id "q-325365" :question/problem "Calculate the asymptotes of the hyperbola $\\frac{{y}^{2}}{12}-\\frac{(x+3)^{2}}{27}=1.$\n\n$y=\\pm $\n{{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "The standard equation of a vertical hyperbola centered at $(h,k)$ is\n\n$$\n\\frac{(y-k)^{2}}{{a}^{2}}-\\frac{(x-h)^{2}}{{b}^{2}}=1.\n$$\n\nFor a vertical hyperbola, the equations of the asymptotes are\n\n$$\ny-k=\\pm \\frac{a}{b}(x-h).\n$$\n\nIn our case, we have \n\n$$\n(h,k)=(-3,0),\\,a=\\sqrt{12}=2\\sqrt{3},\\,b=\\sqrt{27}=3\\sqrt{3}.\n$$\n\n \n\nTherefore, the asymptotes are given by\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y-0 & =\\pm (\\frac{2\\sqrt{3}}{3\\sqrt{3}})(x-(-3)) \\\\ y & =\\pm \\,\\frac{2}{3}(x+3).\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-325365/field-1"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "ace3c4b0-6b1c-595d-bc60-b89e2b24f6b4"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-325365"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-325369/field-1/be9eb51cc2f690a7d5b4aa400428edabf5a5d631a176c92b7f40bdd47725ed03" :answer/id #uuid "c8735dab-3e76-53bb-8a25-9fcd08c92350" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "4" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-325369/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "b381d918-9cf3-569b-9cb8-4eadf5c85e7e" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-325369/field-1/be9eb51cc2f690a7d5b4aa400428edabf5a5d631a176c92b7f40bdd47725ed03" :answer-field/choices ["q-325369/field-1/be9eb51cc2f690a7d5b4aa400428edabf5a5d631a176c92b7f40bdd47725ed03"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-325369/field-2/78da8a4c0448da1fe9380fa1788dd033a4204b6df3722b7d284cb0fc8bc520d4" :answer/id #uuid "7334602b-ec91-5393-a858-4fd28a887add" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{2}{3}x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-325369/field-2" :answer-field/id #uuid "db02c27f-3f3d-5556-b5d7-bd493458efdf" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-325369/field-2/78da8a4c0448da1fe9380fa1788dd033a4204b6df3722b7d284cb0fc8bc520d4" :answer-field/choices ["q-325369/field-2/78da8a4c0448da1fe9380fa1788dd033a4204b6df3722b7d284cb0fc8bc520d4"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-325369" :question/id #uuid "ba94fa4e-99b5-5217-b9f3-8081f688e63d" :question/math-academy-id "q-325369" :question/problem "Calculate the asymptotes of the hyperbola $\\frac{(y+4)^{2}}{8}-\\frac{{x}^{2}}{18}=1.$\n\n$y\\,\\,+$\n{{field-1}}\n$=\\pm $\n{{field-2}}" :question/worked-solution "The standard equation of a vertical hyperbola centered at $(h,k)$ is\n\n$$\n\\frac{(y-k)^{2}}{{a}^{2}}-\\frac{(x-h)^{2}}{{b}^{2}}=1.\n$$\n\nFor a vertical hyperbola, the equations of the asymptotes are\n\n$$\ny-k=\\pm \\frac{a}{b}(x-h).\n$$\n\nIn our case, we have \n\n$$\n(h,k)=(0,-4),\\,a=\\sqrt{8}=2\\sqrt{2},\\,b=\\sqrt{18}=3\\sqrt{2}.\n$$\n\n \n\nTherefore, the asymptotes are given by\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y-(-4) & =\\pm (\\frac{2\\sqrt{2}}{3\\sqrt{2}})(x-0) \\\\ y+4 & =\\pm \\,\\frac{2}{3}x.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-325369/field-1" "q-325369/field-2"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "ace3c4b0-6b1c-595d-bc60-b89e2b24f6b4"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-325369"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-325434/field-1/ad06fa8bb7e77edd4098e00237718855c96ba589745d004ae1aed5be17e6549c" :answer/id #uuid "b3044fdf-a534-5cef-b6f7-ba17f30e4826" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-325434/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "4f238af1-6116-599d-8084-47e905e3f471" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-325434/field-1/ad06fa8bb7e77edd4098e00237718855c96ba589745d004ae1aed5be17e6549c" :answer-field/choices ["q-325434/field-1/ad06fa8bb7e77edd4098e00237718855c96ba589745d004ae1aed5be17e6549c"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-325434/field-2/2c967c01db17160f6d478ec3ecd9161f78e901a3ccac40415a17a1b8ef21c7bd" :answer/id #uuid "51baa54b-1f22-5d89-afc6-449000b9dda8" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{5}{2}(x-3)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-325434/field-2" :answer-field/id #uuid "0674679d-1cda-50c6-abaf-5a8e0e5fe74a" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-325434/field-2/2c967c01db17160f6d478ec3ecd9161f78e901a3ccac40415a17a1b8ef21c7bd" :answer-field/choices ["q-325434/field-2/2c967c01db17160f6d478ec3ecd9161f78e901a3ccac40415a17a1b8ef21c7bd"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-325434" :question/id #uuid "babf6353-821a-51d2-8a25-894755482c42" :question/math-academy-id "q-325434" :question/problem "Calculate the asymptotes of the hyperbola $25{x}^{2}-4{y}^{2}-150x-8y+121=0.$\n\n$y\\,\\,+$\n{{field-1}}\n$=\\pm $\n{{field-2}}" :question/worked-solution "Group the $x$ and $y$ terms and complete the square:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}25{x}^{2}-4{y}^{2}-150x-8y+121 & =0 \\\\ 25({x}^{2}-6x)-4({y}^{2}+2y)+121 & =0 \\\\ 25\\,[(x-3)^{2}-9]-4\\,[(y+1)^{2}-1]+121 & =0 \\\\ 25(x-3)^{2}-225-4(y+1)^{2}+4+121 & =0 \\\\ 25(x-3)^{2}-4(y+1)^{2} & =100 \\\\ \\frac{25(x-3)^{2}}{100}-\\frac{4(y+1)^{2}}{100} & =1 \\\\ \\frac{(x-3)^{2}}{4}-\\frac{(y+1)^{2}}{25} & =1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThus it is a horizontal hyperbola\n\n$$\n\\frac{(x-h)^{2}}{{a}^{2}}-\\frac{(y-k)^{2}}{{b}^{2}}=1,\n$$\n\nso the asymptotes are\n\n$$\ny-k=\\pm \\frac{b}{a}(x-h).\n$$\n\nHere,\n\n$$\n(h,k)=(3,-1),\\,a=\\sqrt{4}=2,\\,b=\\sqrt{25}=5.\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y-(-1) & =\\pm (\\frac{5}{2})(x-3) \\\\ y+1 & =\\pm \\,\\frac{5}{2}(x-3).\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-325434/field-1" "q-325434/field-2"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "56abbbc0-080d-5586-931f-957bd2b793b9"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-325434"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]}]
